## 📌 Learnings & Key Takeaways
- Read Replicas are for **scaling reads** and are read-only.
- Multi-AZ is for **High Availability**, whereas Read Replicas are for **performance**.
- Always delete RDS instances and Snapshots after lab practice to remain within **Free Tier** limits
